<h1><span lang="EN-GB">Display Localiser Position</span></h1>
<hr align="left" width="98.974%" size="6" class="whs3">
<p class="Description"><b><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span></b> <span class="Command">Display Localiser Position</span> <span lang="EN-GB">hides/shows the Localiser Position window, which can be docked in</span> <u><span lang="EN-GB"><a href="../User_Interface/Scan_Pane_(Arm_Menu).htm">Scan Pane</a></span></u> <span lang="EN-GB">below the localiser driven menu or can be &#160;displayed as floating window.</span></p>
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:justify;"><span lang="EN-GB">This window displays localiser probe position according to the global co-ordinate system (World CS) or the co-ordinate system defined by the transformation that updated the Current CS. Co-ordinates are updated with the rate of returned positions by localiser per second.</span></p>
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:justify;">Co-ordinates appearance can be customised from <a href="Preferences_-_Display_-_Localiser_Position.htm">System &gt; Preferences &gt; Display &gt; Localiser Position</a>.</p>
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:justify;"><span lang="EN-GB">When Workspace is hidden this command is unavailable. This command is accessible from</span> <i style="font-style:normal;"><span class="Path">View &gt; Display Localiser Position</span><span class="Path" style="font-weight:normal; font-style:normal;">. It has three sub-menus:</span></i></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>None</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">- the Localiser Position window is hidden.</span></p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Docked</b></span> - the Localiser Positon window is displayed in Scan Pane under the localiser driven menu.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="whs4"><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="../images/localiser_position_window.jpg" width="261px" height="432px" border="0" class="img_whs5" alt=""></span></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Floating</b></span> - the Localiser Position window is displayed as floating window. Place the mouse cursor over the window, hold the left mouse button, and move the mouse to drag the window around the screen. Note that it can be placed also outside KUBE application area. Floating Localiser Position window can be resized like any other window - by holding the left mouse button when cursor is on the borders and moving the mouse. In this case the characters are resized so that they fit the window.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="bullet" style="margin-left:40px;"><img src="../images/localiser_menu_window_floating.gif" width="756px" height="517px" border="0" class="img_whs6" alt=""></p>
